<h2 id="3d-printed-parts-list">3D printed parts list</h2>
<p>Download the STL files from the <a href="/resources/trainer-tpu-parts/">64D TPU parts</a> and <a href="/resources/trainer-petg-parts/">PETG parts</a> pages. The material for each part is listed below.</p>
